&lt;p&gt;📄 The W3C has &lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/181518/rss" style=" color: #D94306; font-weight: 600;"&gt;shared a 'CSS Snapshot 2026' document&lt;/a&gt; that defines the current state of the CSS spec (note, though, that it's targeted at implementers rather than web developers).&lt;/p&gt;
