&lt;p&gt;🏀 In a couple of days' time, sixteen of the &lt;em&gt;'most elite CSS developers from around the world'&lt;/em&gt; will &lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/181519/rss" style=" color: #D94306; font-weight: 600;"&gt;battle it out for the chance to be dubbed a CSS champion&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
